{"tmdb":1281096,"tagline":"","synopsis":"A cargo ship embarks on its final voyage of the year to resupply Inuit communities in the far north of Canada. During a storm off the coast of Labrador, the ship’s cook is found murdered in his cabin. With no way to identify the culprit among the twenty crew members, suspicion falls on Alupa, an Inuit mechanic and close friend of the victim.  Unfolding in reverse, from the investigation back to the night of the storm and the murder, the film transcends the boundaries of a traditional whodunit to probe deeper questions of race, class, and sexual desire.","directors":[{"name":"Rodrigue Jean","id":1024444}],"cast":[{"actor":"Christopher Angatookalook","role":"Alupa Tulugak","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yxh1hkSit3uzFG75VDKwckYIlXF.jpg","tmdb":6133165},{"actor":"Alexandre Landry","role":"Alex Landry","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/OmGOXEqqFspcS3pP3uwSkEefVj.jpg","tmdb":1199734},{"actor":"Gabrielle Poulin","role":"Michelle","photo":null,"tmdb":2746176},{"actor":"Jassinth Thiagarajah","role":"Shakir","photo":null,"tmdb":6133169},{"actor":"Arsaniq Deer","role":"Donna","photo":null,"tmdb":6133170},{"actor":"Tatiana Zinga Botao","role":"Sarah Grey","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hqd4ZnnFYnxx3zWDf7IyxPrgxex.jpg","tmdb":2282167},{"actor":"Max Laferriere","role":"Procureur Éric Fortin","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bVqfKgIYKCSk0TO3BhqbMwTbjaD.jpg","tmdb":1638250},{"actor":"Jérémie Earp","role":"Enquêteur Smith","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gpeHCyxGAkrDQfZ3nTiqBEiWoov.jpg","tmdb":1912281},{"actor":"Marie-France Marcotte","role":"Juge Lussier","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7qKCbxxf6wnRWpDwrejqVSpgqay.jpg","tmdb":32889},{"actor":"Johanne Haberlin","role":"Greffière","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xgk5gZqOEAwFcD2KW71Odk2vhcC.jpg","tmdb":1114393},{"actor":"Denis Marchand","role":"Enquêteur SQ","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tQQ6PDzcbRVPTv4TKTxJOO6Fwxx.jpg","t